 (type class objref)←getObj Name
⍝ Resolve an object name to its Type, class definition namespace and own namespace.
⍝
⍝ type is '' if Name is not an EWC object; class is ⎕NULL if it is the placeholder
⍝ ∆WC leaves behind for an unsupported class, which callers must test for before
⍝ dereferencing it. Reads caller from its own caller's stack frame.

 :Trap 0
     objref←caller⍎Name
     type←objref.Type
     class←findClass type
 :Else
     (type class objref)←'' ⎕NULL ⎕NULL
 :EndTrap
